# Archived bundles: megabytes of OverDrive's minified app per release, re-fetchable with libby-fetch
# while a version is live and recoverable from a HAR after it rolls. PRIORS.md is what we actually
# keep — the facts read out of these, and which module to re-read when one changes.
versions/

# The root .gitignore drops every bin/ as build output; these are the tools.
!bin/
